	######################################################
	# Command strip (title board): two fixed rows.
	# Row 1 says what is going on; row 2 left holds neutral or arming controls,
	# row 2 right the exit (for a selected tile: the red Merge last stack).
	# A red control never takes a harmless one's slot.
